# Website assets (Buildschmiede site)

## Own chrome only

Develop **own** UI chrome and textures for the website (`src/`, assembled `index.html` / `synergien.html`):

- CSS, SVG, hand-made PNG/WebP
- Layout, panels, tabs, borders, corners, backgrounds — all original

## Do NOT embed Ascension / WoW BLP UI chrome

Never copy or embed client **BLP** (or BLP-converted) panel chrome into the site, including but not limited to:

- DialogFrame / UI-Panel / PaperDoll tab art
- `caCorner` and similar frame-kit corners/borders
- Full UI frame kits from Interface extracts

Read-only research in client extracts is fine; shipping those textures as site chrome is not.

## Allowed from client extracts

**Spell and item icons only** — via the existing pipeline (`sprite.webp` / `spriteindex.json`, `D.iic` icon names → icons). Not full UI frame kits.
